# Map Images — DM Palette Curation
#
# This file is OPTIONAL. The map's "Add image" tool auto-discovers
# every supported image file under public/images/ and shows them
# alphabetically with the filename (minus extension) as the label.
#
# Use this file when you want to:
#   - Pin specific images to the top of the palette in a chosen
#     order (curated entries appear first; auto-discovered files
#     are appended at the end).
#   - Override the displayed label for a file.
#
# To activate, copy this file to data/map_images.yaml and edit:
#
#   cp docs/map_images_config.yaml.example data/map_images.yaml
#
# Each entry has:
#   src   — Path under /images/, served from public/images/. Must
#           start with /images/ (other paths are ignored — drop the
#           file into public/images/ and reference it from there).
#   label — What the DM sees as the tooltip in the palette. Defaults
#           to the filename without extension when omitted.
#
# Supported extensions: .png .jpg .jpeg .gif .webp
# Each token is rendered at one grid square (50 viewBox units) and
# snaps to the center of whichever square the DM clicks on.

- label: Lysander
  src:   /images/Lysander.webp

- label: Olga the Reaver
  src:   /images/Olga.webp

- label: Stumpy
  src:   /images/Stumpy2.webp

- label: Cottonballs
  src:   /images/Cottonballs.webp
